 "basis": "ADR 0019 (founder decisions Oct 16 2026; blueprint sections 12, 50-52, 54): agents prepare and never commit; nothing is bought until cleared client funds cover the approved price in full; the purchase authorization must match the quotes exactly (amount, vendor) and is Andre's alone; a second submission of an open order is DUPLICATE_ORDER_BLOCKED; vendor text is untrusted data; AEGIS round 1 (Oct 16 2026): one bank transfer funds one campaign whatever its spelling (H1), a unit is never priced or bought twice in one order (H2), one face is one live unit record (M1), a vendor answer never promotes a disputed campaign (M2), a funds record must move money (M3); AEGIS round 2: zero padding never makes a second transfer (R2-H1); one face, one overlapping flight, one open order across all tenants, refused without naming the other tenant (R2-M3); free text never gives a registered vendor a second identity (R2-M1)",
